## mattpocock/skills

https://github.com/mattpocock/skills

`.agents/skills/grill/SKILL.md` is derived from the "grilling" skill in that
repository. The interview stance, the design-tree framing, and the rule that
questions are asked in dependency-ordered rounds originate there. The text
has been rewritten for Antigravity / Gemini, and the frontier model, the "facts are your
job, decisions are theirs" rule, and the handoffs to the skills in this repo
are our own.

`.agents/skills/diagnosing-bugs/SKILL.md` is derived from the
"diagnosing-bugs" skill in that repository. The phase structure and its
central claim -- that a tight, red-capable feedback loop is the whole skill
and no hypothesis may precede it -- originate there. The text has been
rewritten, and its generic redaction guidance has been replaced with
default-deny telemetry rules.

